  "body": "Privately positioned in an established Orewa neighbourhood, this inviting home offers comfortable living today, together with genuine scope to add value and make it your own. \r\n\r\nInside, the layout includes open-plan living and dining, creating a comfortable and functional setting for everyday life.\r\n\r\nA real point of difference is the exceptionally large basement. This substantial area provides valuable additional space and could suit storage, a workshop, hobbies or further improvement, subject to any necessary approvals.\r\n\r\nThe overall outdoor area is generous. The existing entertaining deck needs restoration, but it lays the groundwork for a real outdoor living and entertaining area. Quotes are available so buyers can move forward with confidence.\r\n\r\nConveniently located within easy reach of Orewa Beach, the town centre, local schools and motorway connections, this property could be an ideal first home, a smart next step or a well-located investment.\r\n\r\nOur overseas-based owner is selling up, creating a genuine opportunity for the next owner to secure the property and unlock its future potential. Call Lane today.\r\n\r\nTo view all available documents please copy and paste the following link:  https://www.propertyfiles.co.nz/property/15aNgahere\r\n\r\nPlease be aware that this information has been sourced from third parties. View our property information disclaimer here: raineandhorne.co.nz/property-disclaimer",
